  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0:\n- OpenMediatR is now AnyMediator. Package IDs, namespace and type names change: replace the OpenMediatR package with AnyMediator, using OpenMediatR; with using AnyMediator;, AddOpenMediatR with AddAnyMediator and OpenMediatRConfiguration with AnyMediatorConfiguration. Behavior is the same as OpenMediatR 1.5.0.\n- Documentation: https://adiakys.github.io/AnyMediator/",
